---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于我 · 康予纳安">

  <nav class="nav">
    <a href="/" class="nav-logo">
      <span class="logo-arrow">▶</span>
      <span>康予纳安</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/explore">到处看看</a>
      <a href="/camellya" class="nav-accent">CamEllya</a>
      <a href="/about" class="nav-active">关于我</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="page-main">
    <div class="page-header">
      <span class="page-chip">PLAYER_INFO</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">关于我</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="about-layout">

      <!-- ── LEFT PANEL ── -->
      <div class="about-left">
        <div class="avatar-frame">
          <img src="/images/avatar.jpg" alt="康纳" class="about-avatar" />
          <div class="frame-corner tl"></div>
          <div class="frame-corner tr"></div>
          <div class="frame-corner bl"></div>
          <div class="frame-corner br"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-name-card">
          <div class="about-name">康予纳安</div>
          <div class="about-aka">康纳 · Connor</div>
          <div class="lv-badge">LV.999</div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-tags">
          <span class="tag">兽控</span>
          <span class="tag">电吉他</span>
          <span class="tag">乐队</span>
          <span class="tag">FPV</span>
          <span class="tag">航拍</span>
          <span class="tag">数码科技</span>
          <span class="tag">创作</span>
          <span class="tag">画画</span>
          <span class="tag">音乐</span>
          <span class="tag tag-purple">基督徒</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ── RIGHT CONTENT ── -->
      <div class="about-right">

        <div class="about-section">
          <div class="section-label">
            <span class="label-chip">01</span> 我是谁
          </div>
          <p>我是康纳，一名在家教育的高中生，也是一名基督徒。我的世界很大——从兽设到电吉他，从 FPV 穿越机到数码科技，每一样都是我观察和感受这个世界的方式。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <div class="section-label">
            <span class="label-chip">02</span> 我喜欢什么
          </div>
          <p>我喜欢一切美好的、有美感的、有个性、有审美、有故事和有设计感的东西。我着迷于那种「把我接触到的一切事物都变得富有灵魂和美感」的设计哲学——无论是一帧画面、一段旋律、一个界面、一个角色，我都希望它们可以有属于自己的设计和故事。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <div class="section-label">
            <span class="label-chip">03</span> 我的理想
          </div>
          <p>把脑子里的知识和创意<span class="hl">可视化、结构化</span>，通过自己来整合和实践——我觉得这是个人生命力的体现。</p>
          <p style="margin-top:12px">我希望可以通过这个网站里的作品帮助到别人，同时也满足了自己记录成长的需求。这里的每一篇文章、每一幅画、每一段视频，都是我留给时间的印记。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <div class="section-label">
            <span class="label-chip">04</span> 关于 CamEllya
          </div>
          <p>CamEllya 是我构建的一个创作宇宙，里面住着络雪、百部、晴舒、日出四个角色——他们组成了一支乐队，也承载着我对友情、创作和音乐的所有想象。</p>
          <a href="/camellya" class="cam-link">进入 CamEllya 专区 →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <div class="section-label">
            <span class="label-chip">05</span> 联系我
          </div>
          <p>网站持续更新中，欢迎通过各个板块了解我的创作；邮箱：iukconnor0942@gmail.com</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <span>© 2026 康予纳安</span>
    <span class="footer-dot">持续更新中 ✦</span>
  </footer>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
:root {
  --bg: #080b14;
  --surface: #0d1020;
  --surface-2: #131a2e;
  --purple: #7B5EFF;
  --purple-light: rgba(123,94,255,0.1);
  --purple-border: rgba(123,94,255,0.28);
  --cyan: #4DDFFF;
  --cyan-light: rgba(77,223,255,0.07);
  --cyan-border: rgba(77,223,255,0.25);
  --red: #FF4D8F;
  --text: #E8EAFF;
  --muted: #8B8FA8;
  --hint: #4a4e6a;
  --border: rgba(123,94,255,0.15);
  --font-mono: 'Share Tech Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
}

/* ─ NAV ─ */
.nav {
  background: rgba(13,16,32,0.96);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 14px 32px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
}
.nav-logo {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 7px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text);
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}
.logo-arrow {
  color: var(--cyan);
  font-size: 10px;
  animation: blink 1.4s step-end infinite;
}
@keyframes blink { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0} }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; }
.nav-links a {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--muted);
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  transition: color 0.2s;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--cyan); }
.nav-active { color: var(--cyan) !important; }
.nav-accent { color: var(--red) !important; }

/* ─ PAGE ─ */
.page-main {
  max-width: 960px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 52px 32px 48px;
}
.page-header { margin-bottom: 44px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.page-chip {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--cyan);
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  background: var(--cyan-light);
  border: 1px solid var(--cyan-border);
  padding: 2px 10px;
  border-radius: 2px;
  display: inline-block;
  width: fit-content;
}
.page-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); }

/* ─ LAYOUT ─ */
.about-layout { display: flex; gap: 52px; align-items: flex-start; }

/* ─ LEFT ─ */
.about-left {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: 220px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
  position: sticky;
  top: 80px;
}
.avatar-frame {
  position: relative;
  border: 1px solid var(--purple-border);
  border-radius: 4px;
  overflow: hidden;
  width: 220px;
  height: 220px;
}
.about-avatar { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
/* corner brackets */
.frame-corner {
  position: absolute;
  width: 10px; height: 10px;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 2;
}
.frame-corner.tl { top:-1px; left:-1px; border-top:2px solid var(--cyan); border-left:2px solid var(--cyan); }
.frame-corner.tr { top:-1px; right:-1px; border-top:2px solid var(--cyan); border-right:2px solid var(--cyan); }
.frame-corner.bl { bottom:-1px; left:-1px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--cyan); border-left:2px solid var(--cyan); }
.frame-corner.br { bottom:-1px; right:-1px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--cyan); border-right:2px solid var(--cyan); }

.about-name-card { text-align: center; }
.about-name { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); }
.about-aka {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}
.lv-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 10px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  padding: 3px 14px;
  border-radius: 2px;
  background: var(--purple-light);
  color: var(--purple);
  border: 1px solid var(--purple-border);
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(123,94,255,0.5);
}
.about-tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 6px;
  justify-content: center;
}
.tag {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  padding: 3px 10px;
  border-radius: 2px;
  background: var(--surface-2);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--muted);
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}
.tag-purple {
  background: var(--purple-light);
  border-color: var(--purple-border);
  color: var(--purple);
}

/* ─ RIGHT ─ */
.about-right { flex: 1; }
.about-section { margin-bottom: 34px; }
.section-label {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.label-chip {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--cyan);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  background: var(--cyan-light);
  border: 1px solid var(--cyan-border);
  padding: 2px 7px;
  border-radius: 2px;
}
.about-section p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.95; }
.hl { color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 500; }
.cam-link {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 14px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--red);
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  transition: color 0.2s;
}
.cam-link:hover { color: var(--purple); }

/* ─ FOOTER ─ */
.footer {
  padding: 16px 32px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--hint);
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.footer-dot { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--purple); }

/* ─ MOBILE ─ */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .nav { padding: 12px 16px; }
  .nav-links { gap: 14px; }
  .nav-links a { font-size: 12px; }
  .page-main { padding: 28px 16px; }
  .about-layout { flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }
  .about-left { width: 100%; position: static; }
  .avatar-frame { width: 180px; height: 180px; }
  .page-title { font-size: 22px; }
  .about-section p { font-size: 14px; }
  .footer { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 20px 16px; }
}
</style>